 proxmod (>= 0.1.0),
Description: token-authorised storage ops for proxmox-csi-plugin
 A proxmod extension providing two REST endpoints under
 /nodes/{node}/proxmod/csi-storage: cross-storage volume copy (used by
 proxmox-csi-plugin's migration controller and volume snapshots) and
 disk-ownership reassignment (wraps Proxmox's built-in move_disk
 target-vmid). Both are gated by explicit ACL checks instead of PVE's
 root@pam-only defaults, so proxmox-csi-plugin can use a scoped API token
 instead of root credentials.
 .
 Supersedes the hack/pve-token-copy systemd-wrapper workaround shipped
 directly in proxmox-csi-plugin, which predates proxmod.
